  "title": "Gerry&#39;s Irish Beef Stew",
  "description": "This hearty Irish stew made with beef, potatoes, carrots, celery, and onion is an easy, one-pot meal for St. Patrick&#39;s Day or any cold, blustery day.",
  "authors": [
